# Virtual equilibrium request, not a synthesis recipe or a time prediction.
# Same reaction, two initial conditions. Reactants can form ester; starting
# with ester and water instead drives hydrolysis in the reverse direction.
# The explicit command uses the existing ideal-mixture K=4 model, not a
# measured rate, catalyst model, or nonideal liquid activity calculation.
register lv3
add v1 CH3COOH 0.01mol
add v1 ethanol 0.01mol
react v1 esterification
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 0.01mol
add v2 ethyl_acetate 0.01mol
react v2 esterification
inspect v2
